with Sunday closures January–March.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sdsu-mccrory-gardens","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"McCrory Gardens","title":"Walk the public arboretum trails","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon • McCrory Gardens","notes":"Take the accessible public arboretum trails for an outdoor reset, and save the formal gardens for a time when you have valid SDSU ID or paid admission.","short_summary":"A free public trail walk beside SDSU’s gardens.","evidence_claim":"SDSU states that McCrory Gardens’ arboretum has about 1.6 miles of public-accessible trails open from dawn to dusk and free to explore.","source_url":"https://www.sdstate.edu/mccrory-gardens/plan-your-visit-mccrory","source_title":"Plan Your Visit to McCrory | South Dakota State University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The arboretum trails are free and open dawn to dusk. Formal-garden hours and admission vary seasonally; SDSU students receive free entry with valid SDSU ID.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sdsu-first-bank-trust-arena","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"First Bank & Trust Arena","title":"Check the arena calendar for a game","subtitle":"Saturday evening • First Bank & Trust Arena","notes":"If the public event calendar has a suitable game or match, attend it; otherwise, walk by the renovated arena and save a ticketed event for another weekend.","short_summary":"The current home venue for Jackrabbit basketball, volleyball, and wrestling.","evidence_claim":"SDSU says First Bank & Trust Arena opened in fall 2024 and serves as the home competition venue for Jackrabbit basketball, volleyball, and wrestling.","source_url":"https://www.sdstate.edu/buildings/first-bank-trust-arena","source_title":"First Bank & Trust Arena building | South Dakota State University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Event availability and admission vary; use the official athletics or arena calendar before planning an entry.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sdsu-coolidge-sylvan-theatre","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Coolidge Sylvan Theatre","title":"Close with an outdoor landmark walk","subtitle":"Sunday afternoon • Coolidge Sylvan Theatre","notes":"Visit the outdoor theatre and its hand-forged gates, then look for public plays, concerts, or celebrations scheduled there later in the semester.","short_summary":"A historic outdoor stage still used for campus occasions.","evidence_claim":"SDSU says Coolidge Sylvan Theatre was dedicated in 1927, retains hand-forged gates, and is still used for plays, inaugurations, and outdoor celebrations.","source_url":"https://www.sdstate.edu/buildings/coolidge-sylvan-theatre","source_title":"Coolidge Sylvan Theatre building | South Dakota State University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"This is an outdoor landmark; check the university event calendar for public performances or celebrations.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
